OL,3,GNEWSACountdown record-breaker reflects
OL,4,Aon dyslexia struggles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who won a record-breaking
OL,7,Fnumber of games on Countdown has
OL,8,Fdescribed her success as "crazy", after
OL,9,Fonce fearing dyslexia would hold her
OL,10,Fback.
OL,12,FHazel Drury, from Ramsey, became the
OL,13,Fhighest scoring woman to win eight
OL,14,Fconsecutive episodes of the Channel 4
OL,15,Fprogramme.
OL,17,FThe 29-year-old was diagnosed with
OL,18,Fdyslexia when she was 15 and said it
OL,19,Fmeant she struggled to complete her
OL,20,Fexams.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
